The classical excerpts in `zh/classics.md` are public-domain Chinese texts
(Tao Yuanming, Fan Zhongyan, Han Yu, Ouyang Xiu, Wang Xizhi and Su Shi) with
modern punctuation; those texts remain in the public domain. The table, math
and book fixtures are generated by code and may be used under the same
CC-BY-4.0 terms.

The engine, templates and tools are Apache-2.0; see the repository `LICENSE`.
